  "description": {
    "text": "The Eevee Advanced Gift Boxes (伊布进阶礼盒) came out on 26 April 2024 in three versions, Vaporeon, Jolteon and Flareon, following on from the earlier Eevee-GX set gift box. Each held its Pokémon's V and VMAX holo and a special-art VMAX holo, with themed sleeves and a binder, three packs each of Nine Colours Gathering Friend and Origin (25 cards) and two Final Flame Dance packs. Each box also held part of a set of Eevee-themed battle accessories: the Vaporeon box a playmat and its case, the Jolteon box special-condition markers, a coin die, damage-counter dice and a case, and the Flareon box a deck box.\n\nThey were sold by pre-order from 29 March to 14 April 2024, through Pokémon's gyms and partner shops, its Tmall store and its Douyin store; buyers collected them from 26 April. Flareon is a Single Strike Pokémon and Vaporeon a Rapid Strike Pokémon.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: Final Flame Dance and the Eevee Advanced Gift Boxes arrive in April (22 March 2024)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/15904.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: Pre-orders for the Eevee Advanced Gift Boxes (22 March 2024)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/15903.html"
      }
    ]
  },
